  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SheTrades Commonwealth+ Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SheTrades Commonwealth+ Programme (STC+) has been operating in Kenya since 2018, aiming to increase the participation of women in trade by engaging with women-led businesses, business support organizations, and private sector partners and promoting inclusive policy and data in Commonwealth countries and its key trading partners. For the Financial Year (FY) 2025&#x2013;26, the focus of Programme interventions will be market-oriented, with an emphasis on enhancing market access while complementing these efforts with targeted capacity building.</narrative>
  </description>
